rt round. Keep round logic there.\n\"\"\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"- tapzero's `t.throws` is async\"\"\",\"\"\"- The fake pi's `FAKE_PI_RESPONSES` takes `hang` (never exits),\n  for interrupting a CLI run mid-loop: wait until\n  `FAKE_PI_COUNTER` shows the hanging call started, then SIGINT\n- tapzero's `t.throws` is async\"\"\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit diff --stat; npm run lint 2>&1 | tail -5"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_012NJnpPmkAAhQTCogG4qkGG":{"cwd":"/Users/nick/code/redeye.adversarial-review-06-resume-an-interrupted-loop"}}}
